  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Quito Metropolitan Urban Transport System</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Sistema Metropolitano de Transporte Urbano Quito</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El programa financiar la construccin de 22 km de va, 15 estaciones, material rodante y equipamioento para el Metro de Quito. El metro conformar el Sistema Integrado de Transporte Metropolitano junto con las lneas de BRT y buses urbanos con os cuales habr integracin tarifaria.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program will finance the construction of 22 km of railway, 15 stations, rolling stock and equipment for the metro system in Quito. This underground metro will be part of the Metropolitan Transport Integrated System together with 4 BRT lines and other bus routes with which tariffs are to be integrated.</narrative>
  </description>
